# el-f4-boxer-turbo: 3 s holds at throttle 1, with 0.5 s sweeps between them.
hold 820 1 3
sweep 820 2000 1 0.5
hold 2000 1 3
sweep 2000 3000 1 0.5
hold 3000 1 3
sweep 3000 4000 1 0.5
hold 4000 1 3
sweep 4000 5000 1 0.5
hold 5000 1 3
sweep 5000 6000 1 0.5
hold 6000 1 3
sweep 6000 6700 1 0.5
hold 6700 1 3
